      "content": "is it really that big of a deal though? it's just a small spot. i looked it up and sometimes stuff like this is just cellulitis which people say you can manage if you catch it early. if i just take some of those leftover antibiotics my friend gave me, would that be enough to nip it in the bud before i have to deal with a clinic? i just want to get rid of it fast.",
